{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/extras/034d24d5afacff86178c9a8c4dae8069.avif?t=1764519746\" alt=\"It&#039;s 1926 in New York City...\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and Emile de la Roche is many things to many people.\u00a0 A French aristocrat, leaving a slew of proposals unanswered in Calais.\u00a0 A visiting <i>bon vivant</i>, sampling the finest of the Big Apple.\u00a0 The 'Queen of France', a performer and fleeting star of the pansy scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth?\u00a0 Emile de la Roche is an illiterate con artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>He might not even be French.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/extras/12557dbdd3395bfc54873c366c7e594a.avif?t=1764519746\" alt=\"Enter: The Mark\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then Emile meets Alex Warren, a mobster's closeted son exiled from Seattle when family affairs got messy.\u00a0 Rich, na\u00efve and out of his depth in New York's underworld, it should be easy to rip him off and hop the next train. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's precisely what Emile and Jackie, his best friend and fixer, intend to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you know how these stories go, right?\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/extras/98128b378600b5db321bd32bce54a8f3.avif?t=1764519746\" alt=\"Nothing&#039;s ever that easy\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our heroes are con artists, thieves, and murderers. They\u2019re Great War deserters and draft dodgers, carrying night terrors and trauma, and they're lying to survive every day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an era where prohibition forced the best of high society down into the same underground drinking holes as the lowest of the low, they may rub shoulders with old money or mobsters... but they're<i> always</i> faking it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/extras/7e9e1fc278d354d363f425674991f421.avif?t=1764519746\" alt=\"Features\" width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An LGBTQ crime-capering romance set in the roaring twenties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Script by award-winning stage &amp; TV writer Conway McDermott</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by an indie team of approximately three queers in a trenchcoat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn CGs and sprites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original arrangements of jazz standards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodes one &amp; two available in Early Access</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serialized over six planned episodes, with future episodes to be added in updates during Early Access</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry about making  bad decisions, just enjoy the consequences... for now. Early episodes are mostly linear, but you never know what might come back to haunt you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be gay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do crime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Come Hear the Music Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811440/a6a44c91215e1da21655f913db69df2992150c43.jpg"},{"name":"Living in a Den of Thieves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811440/3623b1a432e3cbbac924b585072ee8332d1a7774.jpg"},{"name":"Waiting for the Big One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811440/254d018ca092564facc6cdd7032e0d52c929335a.jpg"},{"name":"I\u2019ve Had Good Times with Some Bad Guys","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811440/77bb3107dd6416c2319564f01d8595214d3fd7cf.jpg"},{"name":"Capsized, Erring on the Edge of Safe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811440/b18586e4a539704a036f03972a3fc89f19f1d482.jpg"},{"name":"What Could a Crook Know About Love?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811440/358b6dafdf8f0c04bdb51155bbc0c4b58ab86d8f.jpg"},{"name":"Oh Jackie, We're Really in it Now","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3811440/74bb410585b0cb539bcc195363242f5aff175e89.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3811440?t=1764519746","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/a1e77be610db09571601abf95f42dc182922ee02/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764519746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/1ec42bdccaa8801634ef6829e9e1df8c30853254/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764519746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/1ec42bdccaa8801634ef6829e9e1df8c30853254/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764519746","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains mature themes, including strong language, criminal activity, period-specific bigotry and homophobic slurs, use of alcohol, and depictions of violence. Use of slurs can be censored via the settings menu.\r\n\r\nFuture episodes of the game will include scenes with non-explicit sexual content. These may explore adult relationships, emotional manipulation, and morally ambiguous situations. All such content will be clearly signposted with content warnings and an option will be provided to censor sexual content via the settings menu."},"demos":[{"appid":3849590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/extras/034d24d5afacff86178c9a8c4dae8069.avif?t=1764519746\" alt=\"It&#039;s 1926 in New York City...\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and Emile de la Roche is many things to many people.\u00a0 A French aristocrat, leaving a slew of proposals unanswered in Calais.\u00a0 A visiting <i>bon vivant</i>, sampling the finest of the Big Apple.\u00a0 The 'Queen of France', a performer and fleeting star of the pansy scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth?\u00a0 Emile de la Roche is an illiterate con artist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>He might not even be French.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/extras/12557dbdd3395bfc54873c366c7e594a.avif?t=1764519746\" alt=\"Enter: The Mark\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then Emile meets Alex Warren, a mobster's closeted son exiled from Seattle when family affairs got messy.\u00a0 Rich, na\u00efve and out of his depth in New York's underworld, it should be easy to rip him off and hop the next train. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's precisely what Emile and Jackie, his best friend and fixer, intend to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you know how these stories go, right?\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/extras/98128b378600b5db321bd32bce54a8f3.avif?t=1764519746\" alt=\"Nothing&#039;s ever that easy\" width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our heroes are con artists, thieves, and murderers. They\u2019re Great War deserters and draft dodgers, carrying night terrors and trauma, and they're lying to survive every day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an era where prohibition forced the best of high society down into the same underground drinking holes as the lowest of the low, they may rub shoulders with old money or mobsters... but they're<i> always</i> faking it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/extras/7e9e1fc278d354d363f425674991f421.avif?t=1764519746\" alt=\"Features\" width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An LGBTQ crime-capering romance set in the roaring twenties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Script by award-winning stage &amp; TV writer Conway McDermott</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by an indie team of approximately three queers in a trenchcoat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn CGs and sprites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original arrangements of jazz standards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodes one &amp; two available in Early Access</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serialized over six planned episodes, with future episodes to be added in updates during Early Access</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't worry about making  bad decisions, just enjoy the consequences... for now. Early episodes are mostly linear, but you never know what might come back to haunt you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be gay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do crime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Haunted Trumpet"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811440/6d131fb6d273f889a25205b91866ba026eb5abbd/header.jpg?t=1764519746","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Haunted Trumpet Limited. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 (High Sierra)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal-compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3811440/1844341979/6d59eb2c650405cc8ff638c56b31a6933de7c2b9/1750365101/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750879466","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3811440/1844341979/6d59eb2c650405cc8ff638c56b31a6933de7c2b9/1750365101/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750879466","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3811440/1844341979/6d59eb2c650405cc8ff638c56b31a6933de7c2b9/1750365101/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750879466","id":257154779,"name":"Emile de la Roche is...","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154779/f04bc3c0da8129b58b81a58588d34be5ed068d8e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750879466"}],"name":"The Left Eye","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","se